  {
   "section": "Tires",
   "text": "I observed that the tires of the vehicle are matched with tire brand and sizes however, I noticed that the front right tire shows 4/32 of tire tread depth remaining. I found no issue or curb rash on wheel rims of the vehicle."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The exterior of the vehicle was dusty at time of inspection. This can hide minor imperfections. This vehicle has excessive scratches all over the exterior. I noticed a dent on the passenger rear quarter panel. Refer to photo #3. I noticed that the passenger mirror motor is not functioning, and the mirror glass is broken. Refer to photo #110. I noticed chips and scratches on the front bumper. The windshield has a crack. Refer to photo #65."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "I observed that the steering wheel shows wear. There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. I noticed minor dirt stains on the seats. I noted scratches and scuffed marks on the inner door panels. The interior trim of the vehicle shows wear. I noticed that the trim and bed of the cargo area shows scratches and scuff marks. The center console shows wear. I noticed some damage on the leather material of the compartment lid cover. Refer to photo #44. The carpet shows moderate wear from use. The floor mats are dirty. I noticed minor dirt stains present on the inner door panels."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The air filter is dirty and needs to be replaced. The engine oil is dirty and should be changed. I noticed that the brake rotors edges show signs of rust. Surface rust can be found on some portions of the exhaust pipe, welds, and flanges. The exhaust pipe and muffler system has no leaks and sounds good. Only one key fob was shown during inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "During the road test, I heard a wheel bearing making noise, resonating throughout the vehicle. Further diagnosis is needed to determine which wheel has the faulty bearing. I hooked up my Scan Tool to the computer system and found no current or pending codes. All of the live data looked good, with no reported issues."
  }
